{"id":4434,"date":"2025-02-03T14:10:40","date_gmt":"2025-02-03T04:40:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?post_type=video&#038;p=4434"},"modified":"2025-10-26T16:03:24","modified_gmt":"2025-10-26T06:33:24","slug":"why-data-feed-optimization-matters","status":"publish","type":"video","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/video\/why-data-feed-optimization-matters\/","title":{"rendered":"Why Data Feed Optimization Matters"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"4434\" class=\"elementor elementor-4434\" data-elementor-post-type=\"video\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-01e700d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"01e700d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff7d5b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ff7d5b7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words text-start [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"75dd7c8a-ad57-42b0-a36f-4e282bfccc78\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"><div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\"><p><strong>In this insightful interview, Frank Grasso, CEO and Founder of FeedOps, dives into the critical role of data feed optimization in today&#8217;s competitive ecommerce landscape.<\/strong><\/p><p>While many ecommerce marketers know how to connect their product data to channels like Google Shopping, Frank explains why simply connecting isn\u2019t enough. Learn how optimizing your product data can significantly enhance your digital marketing strategy, driving more relevant traffic, improving SEO for ecommerce, and boosting your marketing ROI.<\/p><p>Frank discusses the importance of ensuring your products are accurately and attractively presented to stand out in a saturated market. Whether you&#8217;re looking to improve your online advertising efforts or seeking to maximize the effectiveness of your ecommerce marketing, this video offers valuable insights that can help you achieve better results.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"featured_media":4435,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"template":"","class_list":["post-4434","video","type-video","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Why Data Feed Optimization Matters - FeedOps<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Learn why data feed optimization is essential for ecommerce success and how improving product data boosts visibility.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/video\/why-data-feed-optimization-matters\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Why Data Feed Optimization Matters\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Learn why data feed optimization is essential for ecommerce success and how improving product data boosts visibility.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/video\/why-data-feed-optimization-matters\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_tim